# What gets uploaded to Vercel as BUILD INPUT.
#
# This is not what gets served. vercel.json sets outputDirectory to "dist",
# so the only things ever fetchable are the files build_min.mjs writes there
# (index.html, robots.txt, sitemap.xml). Source is never served.
#
# The build now actually builds - `npm ci` then `node build.mjs && node
# tools/build_min.mjs` - so unlike the previous whitelist-everything-out
# setup, the build inputs have to be present. Exclude only what the build
# does not need.

node_modules/
dist/
.git/
.github/
.githooks/
.kilo/
.vercel/

# Screenshots, docs and local scratch: large, and irrelevant to the build.
_shot/
_check.js
*.md
!README.md
